    "Scan of the 1970 edition of the Salem, Massachusetts, topographic map at 1:25,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1942; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1970; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1979.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
